<div class="prose">
  <h2>Relational critical engineering</h2>
  <p>
    I call the practice <em>relational critical engineering</em>. Engineering, because it has to
    compile and hold under adversaries. Critical, because a system is never only technical — it
    encodes who may act, who must prove, and who is left answerable. Relational, because the unit
    that matters is not the object but the bond between people that the object mediates. Everything
    above is in service of it.
  </p>

